### bare su and su with a user variable
su
rm stale.pid
su $USER
>>> SC2086 3:4
>>> SC2117 1:1
>>> SC2117 3:1

### su to a user followed by more commands
su deploy
git pull
exit
>>> SC2117 1:1

### su fed from a pipe
echo whoami | su admin
>>> none

### su with stdin from a script
su root < provision.sh
>>> none

### su with a command to run
su -c 'systemctl restart nginx' root
>>> none
